entioned that his grandfather attended some legendary Faiz show in 70s by a female singer. And I was like, WAITTT ‎", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:10:43Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Exactly, mujhe to iski yaad aati hai - https://www.reddit.com/r/CriticalThinkingIndia/s/PDM9asNvap", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:10:47Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "😂😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:10:56Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "He called to check with his father back home. Turns out it was this same concert.\nHis grandfather attended it live!!", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:11:21Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Are yr 🤣", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]